#: ../../general/Ms_description/Transformations_microservice.rst
msgid "Доступные движки:"
msgstr "Available engines:"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/Transformations_microservice.rst
msgid ""
"- ``freemarker`` — для формирования документов в формате docx, txt с "
"обработкой Freemarker."
msgstr ""
"- ``freemarker`` — for generating documents in docx and txt formats with "
